1. `clojure -M:test -n dao.jing.file-test` — three development iterations: a compile error (`thrown?` cannot take a function call — my `(thrown-on-host)` wrapper; fixed by inlining the reader-conditional at each site); then 7 failures, all in raw-frame tests, from two helper bugs of mine (§5b); then **13 tests / 62 assertions, 0 failures**.
